    "title": "見えずとも、その楽しさを",
    "enTitle": "Unseen Happiness",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "夏合宿も、終わりが近づいてきた。\nトレーニングは順調に進んでいる。",
            "enText": "The summer training camp, through which training had been \nprogressing smoothly, was coming to an end.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 88,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 148,
                    "pathId": 4014590642325229414
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6569803380582444526,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "お疲れ様でした。失礼します。",
            "enText": "I will excuse myself here then, good work.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 148,
                    "pathId": -4923305955648086084
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -4413482108324400644
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5828080801021116487,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴはいつも通り、\nトレーニングをすると、余計なことは言わずに去って行く。",
            "enText": "As was always the case, Admire Groove wasted no time \nnor words after training and walked off.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -4178975737580064874
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3099458155842813459,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "はぁ、はぁ……はっ、ふー……ダメ、足りない。\nもっとできるはずよ。こんなんじゃ終われないわ……！",
            "enText": "<i>Hagh… hahh… haah… pheeew…</i> No, I can't stop here. \nThis isn't enough. I can do more…!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 520,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 160,
                    "pathId": -5723409459550083545
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 85,
                    "pathId": -8348902020387360251
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5074885432940342256,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "全力で、本気で、ただ走ることだけを考えるの……！\n私は、誰にも負けられないんだから――！",
            "enText": "I have to put all my effort, all my strength and energy, solely \ninto running…! So that I may never lose… to anyone!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 291,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 55,
                    "pathId": -4648770029533458446
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 3915822714890446894
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4393386046000622198,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "懸命な走りに、ただただ純粋に彼女を応援したいと思う。\n受け入れられずとも、支えてあげられることはないだろうか。",
            "enText": "All I want is to support her, and the way she so wholeheartedly \nplunges herself into running. Even if she won't accept me \nby her side, I wish there was another way I could help.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 8201750384114763732,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同期のトレーナー",
            "enName": "Similarly-Aged Trainer",
            "jpText": "だったら、喜ぶことをしてあげるとか？　思いつくのは、\nご飯を奢ってあげたり、遊びに連れて行ったり……だろうけど。",
            "enText": "You could try doing something nice for her, maybe? \nGranted, all that comes to mind are things like taking \nher out for a meal or a bit of fun and relaxation…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 347,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 7410943234369885456,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同期のトレーナー",
            "enName": "Similarly-Aged Trainer",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴには、向かないよね。",
            "enText": "I… can't see Admire Groove be interested in that.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ですよね……",
                    "enText": "I must agree with you there…",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -247186719367442465,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "どんな答えが返ってくるか予想ができて、\n思わず苦笑いをし、同僚に敬語で返してしまう。",
            "enText": "I knew what my colleagues' replies would be before asking. \nA bit of a wry smile creeps onto my face as I unintentionally \nword my agreement much too stiffly.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -4959601834474331911,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "食事、遊び、プレゼント。\n浮かぶものはどれも、アドマイヤグルーヴが喜ぶものではない。",
            "enText": "Food, entertainment, gifts… Nothing I can think of sounds \nlike anything Admire Groove would particularly care for.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 3899914609276743695,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "自己満足でしかないのなら、するべきではないだろう。\nささやかなものでいい。合宿が楽しかったと思えるような――",
            "enText": "If it's only to fool myself into feeling helpful, I better not. \nIt doesn't need to be much. Just anything that might make her \nlook back on summer camp thinking it had been a good time.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 3945418723945283471,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "犬",
            "enName": "Dog",
            "jpText": "ワン！！",
            "enText": "<i>Woof!!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 50,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 4660582082127685152,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "はっ、はっ、はぁ……はぁ……ふー……。",
            "enText": "<i>Hahh hahh haah… haaah… phoooo…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 216,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": 3841909114660911790
