            "jpName": "帽子をかぶった女性",
            "enName": "Woman Wearing a Hat",
            "jpText": "そうよねぇ、走りたいわよねぇ。ごめんなさいね、\nわたしが腰を痛めちゃったから……あいたたた……。",
            "enText": "Yes yesh, you want to run around, don't you. I'm sorry I can't \nlet you <i>ow</i>… right now because of my back… <i>ow-oww</i>…",
