        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（この子……利口って言われている犬種よね。\n飼い主の顔を、じっと見て……命令を待っているみたいだけど）",
            "enText": "(Isn't that dog… one of those clever breeds? Why does it look \nlike it's eyeing its owner's face… as if awaiting a command.)",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 303,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
