            "jpName": "帽子をかぶった女性",
            "enName": "Woman Wearing a Hat",
            "jpText": "あなた、たくさん走らなくちゃいけない\nワンちゃんなのよね～。運動不足になっちゃうわ～。",
            "enText": "Yeees, I know you need a lot of movement～ \nYou <i>doo</i>, yes, and you're not getting <i>nearly</i> enough now～",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 223,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 234,
